USER presets/flakeModule.nix
USER ```
USER /** Presets are sets of pre-selected options tailored with
USER *   a specific purpose in mind. You can think of them as configuration
USER *   templates.
USER *   If you don't have strong preferences over the configuration of a
USER *   deveopment tool, you can apply presets which will give you a
USER *   good selection of defaults (rather than manually specifying all options)
USER */
USER { ... }:
USER let
USER   imports = [ ./prelude-preset.nix ];
USER in
USER   { inherit imports; }
USER ```
