ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT Also possible: `nixosSystem` with `modules = [ { imports = [...]; config = {...}; } ]` — fine.
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT Another real possibility: they run the VM via `nixos-rebuild build-vm`? No.
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT I'll answer: qemu-vm.nix doesn't wipe fileSystems; the no-error-on-invalid-values test shows the module isn't evaluated; likely the flake module for llm-agent isn't wired (the setup.nix not imported, or the agent not configured so the module never instantiates), or you're running a different app/closure. Give verification commands.
